<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Transdisciplinary Education</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 0;
        }

        h1 {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        ul {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding-left: 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        img {
            width: 90%;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>    <h1 style="margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 32px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; font-size: 12px;">﻿</span><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 400;">Klik op de fakkels langs de route om informatiepagina's te openen.</span><br></h1><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; touch-action: pan-x pan-y;"><br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: none; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; touch-action: pan-x pan-y; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; white-space-collapse: preserve;"></p><h1 style="margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 32px;">
    </h1>
</body>

</html>